```css
.button-primary {
  background-color: #0066cc;
  color: white;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 16px;
  transition: background-color 0.2s;
}

.button-primary:hover {
  background-color: #0052a3;
}
```

HTML для использования:
```html
<button class="button-primary">Нажми меня</button>
```
